    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2044" root="بدو" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدًا</span></b>  The <i>excrement from the anus</i> (M, K *) of
a man. (M.) [And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَآءٌ</span>, from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْدَأَ</span>, signifies the
same.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A joint</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْصِل</span>) of a man; (AA, M,
K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدْءٌ</span>: (AA, M:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْدَآءٌ</span>. (AA, M,
K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَا</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدًا</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدْوٌ</span>, in two places.

